User Request:  
"During a recent network upgrade to support dual-stack operations, we're evaluating how to implement BGP on our Nokia 7750 SR router fleet to simultaneously handle IPv6-labeled unicast routes and EVPN services for our data center fabric. What's the recommended approach to properly configure these address families without causing session instability or route propagation issues?"

