To implement selective forwarding based on predefined administrative tags for BGP next-hop resolution on Nokia 7750 SR routers, configure the BGP next-hop resolution filter to exclusively use SR policies with color matching. This ensures only tunnels carrying matching administrative tags are considered:

```cli
configure router
