To ensure all address families from a BGP peer adhere to a 300-second recovery timer during Graceful Restart, configure the following CLI commands:

```
configure router bgp
group <group-name>
neighbor <ip-address>
graceful-restart
    long-lived
        helper-override-restart-time 300
    exit
exit
```

**Explanation:**  
- `graceful-restart` enables BGP helper functionality at the neighbor level.  
- `long-lived` enters the context for Long-Lived Graceful Restart (LLGR) parameters.  
