```cli
configure router bgp
    graceful-restart
        enable-notification
        long-lived
            forwarding-bits-set all
        exit
    exit
exit
```

**Key actions performed:**  
1. Enabled BGP Graceful Restart at the global level to support IPv6 helper functionality.  
2. Activated `enable-notification` to handle session restarts during control plane errors.  
