   - Preserve IPv6 forwarding state across restarts  
   - Advertise the Forwarding (F) bit for IPv6 to peers  
   - Extend route preservation during prolonged control plane transitions  

This ensures your router maintains IPv6 traffic flows while assisting peers during their restarts.
