To adjust the route preference for labeled-unicast BGP routes to 150 on your Nokia 7750 SR routers, use the following CLI command:

```cli
configure router bgp
    label-preference 150
```

This command sets the administrative distance for all labeled-unicast routes (IPv4 and IPv6) to `150` globally under BGP configuration. Routes with this preference will be deprioritized compared to protocols with lower values (e.g., OSPF internal routes: 10, IS-IS: 15) and preferred only when no lower-preference routes exist. 

