- **Verification**: Use `show router bgp routes label-ipv4` or `label-ipv6` to confirm route installation with preference `150`.

### Additional Notes:
- To apply the preference selectively (e.g., per peer group or neighbor), use the same `label-preference 150` command under `config>router>bgp>group` or `config>router>bgp>group>neighbor`.
- Revert to default behavior (preference 170) with `no label-preference`.
