**Key details:**
- `prefix-limit ipv6 5000`: Caps accepted IPv6 prefixes at 5000
- `threshold 75`: Triggers syslog alerts at 3750 prefixes (75% of 5000)
- `log-only`: Maintains the BGP session even when exceeding the limit while generating syslog alerts
- `family ipv6`: Ensures IPv6 address family is enabled for the neighbor

**Implementation notes:**
1. Replace `<group-name>` and `<neighbor-ip>` with your specific BGP group and neighbor IP
