```

3. Within `rib-management`, configure parameters for specific address families. For example, to set a route policy for importing IPv4 routes into the BGP RIB:
```cli
            ipv4
                route-table-import "POLICY_NAME"
            exit
```

Replace `POLICY_NAME` with your actual route policy name. Repeat this for other address families (`ipv6`, `label-ipv4`, `label-ipv6`) as needed.

