2. A 15-minute timer starts for each stale route.  
3. If a route isn't refreshed (updated) before the timer expires, it is automatically purged.  

The default `mp-bgp-keep` setting (`no mp-bgp-keep`) remains unchanged to ensure routes are eligible for purging when not refreshed. This approach maintains VPN service continuity while enforcing route freshness.
